  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ils se regroupent pour rosser ceux\nqui pénètrent sur leur territoire.\nIls crachent un venin corrosif.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Groups of them beat up anything\nthat enters their territory. Each can\nspit acidic liquid from its mouth.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La plus grande crête détermine le\nmeneur du groupe. Il détruit des\nblocs de béton à coups de pied.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It can smash concrete blocks with its\nkicking attacks. The one with the biggest\ncrest is the group leader.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It pulls up its shed skin to protect\nitself while it kicks. The bigger the\ncrest, the more respected it is.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It pulls up its shed skin to protect\nitself while it kicks. The bigger the\ncrest, the more respected it is.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "だっぴした　かわを　ずりあげて\nダメージを　へらしつつ　キック！\nとさかが　おおきいほど　えらそうだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "탈피한 가죽을 끌어 올려\n데미지를 줄이면서 킥!\n볏이 클수록 거만하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son baggy de peau le protège quand il donne\ndes coups de pied. Les meneurs sont ceux qui ont\nla plus grande crête.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es wehrt Angriffe mit seiner alten Haut ab\nund kontert mit Tritten. Sein Ego entspricht\nder Größe seines Kamms.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se protege de los ataques con la muda de su piel\nmientras reparte patadas. Cuanto mayor es su cresta,\nmás se le respeta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando tira calci, si protegge dai danni con la pelle\ndella muta. Più grande è la cresta e più arie si dà.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It pulls up its shed skin to protect itself while\nit kicks. The bigger the crest, the more respected\nit is.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "脱皮した　皮を　ずりあげて\nダメージを　減らしつつ　キック！\nとさかが　大きいほど　偉そうだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se protege de los ataques con la muda de su piel\nmientras reparte patadas. Cuanto mayor es su cresta,\nmás se le respeta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "とさかの　おおきさで　グループの\nリーダーを　きめる。キックこうげきで\nコンクリートブロックを　はかいする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "볏의 크기로 그룹의\n리더를 정한다. 발차기로\n콘크리트 블록을 파괴한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La plus grande crête détermine le meneur du groupe.\nIl détruit des blocs de béton à coups de pied.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wählt seinen Anführer über die Größe des Kamms\nauf dem Kopf. Ein Tritt von ihm reicht,\num Betonblöcke zu zertrümmern.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El líder del grupo es aquel cuya cresta es mayor.\nEs capaz de romper bloques de cemento con sus\npotentes patadas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
